    - target: {fileID: 1552757545190895822, guid: 2c83ffcf858c39443b48cba36d2ee23a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[0].value
      value: Reads the serial number the payload carries. It runs after the laser
        fires but does not verify the mark - FG_02 does that.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1552757545190895822, guid: 2c83ffcf858c39443b48cba36d2ee23a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[1].value
      value: Enable, then trigger; reads back Ready, Busy, ResultValid and ResultOK.
        The twin echoes the two control bits and hands over the datum; the verdict
        is synthesised in OC_SIM FB_Camera.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1552757545190895822, guid: 2c83ffcf858c39443b48cba36d2ee23a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[3].value
