      value: Not a PLC symbol in its own right - its own Link is disabled by the
        PanelSampler. Pressed state is bit 6 of the H_ControlPanel FB_Panel StatusData;
        its feedback lamp is bit 6 of ControlData.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3621181172599023909, guid: 18d238b384106a34bbce523b7aa9101a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3621181172599023909, guid: 18d238b384106a34bbce523b7aa9101a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[0].value
      value: Main operator panel, TwinCAT/Beckhoff variant. Samples eight push buttons
        - five PackML machine commands and three mode selections - into one PLC symbol,
        and lights each button back from it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3621181172599023909, guid: 18d238b384106a34bbce523b7aa9101a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[1].value
      value: PanelSampler. Disables its children's individual communication and exposes
        one aggregated FB_Panel DWORD, packing their status bits in and unpacking
        control bits back.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3621181172599023909, guid: 18d238b384106a34bbce523b7aa9101a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[2].value
      value: '8 of 32 bits used: bit0 START, bit1 RESET, bit2 STOP, bit3 CLEAR, bit4
        ABORT, bit5 PRODUCTION, bit6 MAINTANANCE, bit7 MANUAL. StatusData carries
        the pressed state in, ControlData drives each button''s lamp at the same
        bit. Order follows the PanelSampler _components list.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3638231754045632853, guid: 18d238b384106a34bbce523b7aa9101a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
