      value: BitLayout
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4889098432861096283, guid: 0524e15ff87e94b489d07189a4b5c900, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[0].value
      value: Cap bunker. Feeds small caps onto the short conveyor that presents them
        at the pick position.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4889098432861096283, guid: 0524e15ff87e94b489d07189a4b5c900, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[1].value
      value: MAIN.FG_05.Y_CapsSource
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4889098432861096283, guid: 0524e15ff87e94b489d07189a4b5c900, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[2].value
      value: ControlBunker
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4889098432861096283, guid: 0524e15ff87e94b489d07189a4b5c900, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[3].value
      value: Two bool outputs from the PLC and no status bits - the bunker reports
        nothing back. MIL turns both on together for as long as it is enabled.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4889098432861096283, guid: 0524e15ff87e94b489d07189a4b5c900, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[4].value
      value: 2 of 8 control bits used. Bit 0 enables the vibration table that feeds
        the bunker, bit 1 enables the short caps conveyor that carries them to the
        pick position. The status byte is unused.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7276993459276830364, guid: 0524e15ff87e94b489d07189a4b5c900, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _bunkerOn
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7276993459276830364, guid: 0524e15ff87e94b489d07189a4b5c900, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _conveyorOn
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
