  - key: Function
    value: Moves the laser head. Service mode only - SequenceUnit1 takes override
      control of it on enable and releases on disable, but never actuates it during
      the normal cycle.
  - key: oc.plcPath
    value: MAIN.FG_01.Y_Platform
  - key: oc.deviceType
    value: Cylinder
  - key: Signal
    value: Double solenoid with both limits read. Service positioning of the laser
      head. Never actuated during the production cycle.
