  - key: Function
    value: Gripper on arm 1, the placing arm. Receives the part from arm 2 at the
      handover and releases it into slot 2.
  - key: oc.plcPath
    value: MAIN.FG_03.Y_Gripper1
  - key: oc.deviceType
    value: Cylinder
  - key: Signal
    value: Double solenoid with both limits read. EXTENDED grips. The limit proves
      the jaws moved, NOT that they caught anything - only B_Detect1 says that.
  _topologySegment: 
  _topologyParent: {fileID: 0}
