    - target: {fileID: 5196632601365859834, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[2].key
      value: Signal
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5196632601365859834, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[3].key
      value: BitLayout
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5196632601365859834, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[4].key
      value: oc.deviceType
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5196632601365859834, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[0].value
      value: Identification read of the ASSEMBLY on the pallet, not of the cap. Mounted
        on the feed side, looking across at the pallet; returns the assembly CapsID.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5196632601365859834, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[1].value
      value: MAIN.FG_05.P_Camera
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5196632601365859834, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[2].value
      value: Enable, then trigger; reads back Ready, Busy, ResultValid and ResultOK.
        The twin echoes the two control bits and hands over the datum; the verdict
        is synthesised in OC_SIM FB_Camera.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5196632601365859834, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[3].value
      value: 2 of 8 control bits, 4 of 8 status bits. Control bit 0 = enable, bit
        1 = trigger. Status bit 0 = Ready, bit 1 = Busy, bit 2 = ResultValid, bit
        3 = ResultOK. ResultOK is meaningless unless ResultValid is set. Identical
        to FG_01 and FG_02.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5196632601365859834, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _entries.Array.data[4].value
      value: DataReader
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5787678648301931998, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: P_Camera
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5787678648301931998, guid: e435b5ff9f158824aaf58afcc07a9d4e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
